<h1 style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;">Create Your Account</h1>
<p>Get started with UTMPro in just a few steps. No credit card required.</p>

<h2>Step 1: Register</h2>
<ol><li>Go to <a href="/register">utmpro.link/register</a></li><li>Enter your <strong>Full Name</strong>, <strong>Email Address</strong>, and choose a <strong>Password</strong> (minimum 8 characters)</li><li>Click <strong>Create Account</strong></li></ol>
<p>You can also register using <strong>Google OAuth</strong> — click "Sign in with Google" for one-click registration.</p>

<h2>Step 2: Verify Your Email</h2>
<p>If email verification is enabled, you'll receive a <strong>6-digit code</strong> by email. Enter it on the verification page within 15 minutes.</p>
<ul><li>Didn't receive the code? Click <strong>Resend Code</strong></li><li>You can also click the verification link in the email</li></ul>

<h2>Step 3: Create Your Workspace</h2>
<p>After verification, you'll be redirected to create your first workspace. This is where your team manages links, analytics, and campaigns.</p>

<h2>First User = Admin</h2>
<p>The very first person to register on a fresh UTMPro installation is automatically promoted to <strong>SuperAdmin</strong>. This gives you access to the <strong>Admin Portal</strong> at <code>/admin</code> where you can manage all users, workspaces, plans, and system settings.</p>

<div style="background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;padding:16px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:1rem;">
<strong>💡 Tip:</strong> Use Google OAuth for the fastest registration — no password to remember, and your email is automatically verified.
</div>
